{"chapter": "formal-defos", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "06HF", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{C}_\\Lambda$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:fb6ad280346362a580dd3b1ba5464da5eea3146f40ecf0a8f3a682476d6fa006", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:acd3efb365735752397f35a2e40e0bc9b63d9fe4d367c9a5a10b946272a77a85", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nIn this section we discuss smooth morphisms of categories\ncofibered in groupoids over <MATH_0001>.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:f09e8784f4eb47f0b8dd5df04e42daa3a3f3e5bc06a0340ca6b23ed0c6d5d66c", "unit_id": "tag:06HF:prose-0001"}
{"chapter": "formal-defos", "node_kind": "definition", "parent_tag": "06HF", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\varphi : \\mathcal{F} \\to \\mathcal{G}$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{C}_\\Lambda$", "MATH_0003": "$\\varphi$", "MATH_0004": "$B \\to A$", "MATH_0005": "$\\mathcal{C}_\\Lambda$", "MATH_0006": "$y \\in\n\\Ob(\\mathcal{G}(B)), x \\in \\Ob(\\mathcal{F}(A))$", "MATH_0007": "$y\n\\to \\varphi(x)$", "MATH_0008": "$B \\to A$", "MATH_0009": "$x' \\in \\Ob(\\mathcal{F}(B))$", "MATH_0010": "$x' \\to x$", "MATH_0011": "$B \\to A$", "MATH_0012": "$\\varphi(x') \\to y$", "MATH_0013": "$\\text{id}: B \\to B$", "MATH_0014": "$$\n\\xymatrix{\n\\varphi(x') \\ar[r] \\ar[dr] & y \\ar[d] \\\\\n& \\varphi(x)\n}\n$$", "TEXTITCLOSE_0001": "}", "TEXTITOPEN_0001": "{\\it "}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{definition}\n\\label{definition-smooth-morphism}\n", "suffix": "\\end{definition}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:4a653a1b81132112f7114df1ca31c69eff490abe30ad7cbcc76782b0630c452f", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:614bfa98389ef67181a48adf8f93643d3cfccebddc41605acce14964cb1725e6", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a morphism of categories\ncofibered in groupoids over <MATH_0002>.  We say  <MATH_0003> is\n<TEXTITOPEN_0001>smooth<TEXTITCLOSE_0001> if it satisfies the following condition: Let <MATH_0004> be\na surjective ring map in <MATH_0005>.  Let <MATH_0006>, and <MATH_0007> be a morphism lying over <MATH_0008>.  Then there\nexists <MATH_0009>, a morphism <MATH_0010>\nlying over <MATH_0011>, and a morphism <MATH_0012> lying\nover <MATH_0013>, such that the diagram\n<MATH_0014>\ncommutes.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:b6083a9e429fbeb226f6a80bca6dfb02d3408b3695deb1cb9d3135c4152cd46a", "unit_id": "tag:06HG:statement"}
{"chapter": "formal-defos", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "06HF", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\varphi : \\mathcal{F} \\to \\mathcal{G}$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{C}_\\Lambda$", "MATH_0003": "$\\varphi$", "MATH_0004": "$B \\to A$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{definition-smooth-morphism}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-smoothness-small-extensions}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:e64372acc0aef9d0c432d12736476d31e0b4e2aaf7f814bf001cb99e9d5e6035", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:81a484421fe412a80d747ee69131a9bdbfa6bda43e58d7bbae72c37f95f77167", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a morphism of categories\ncofibered in groupoids over <MATH_0002>.  Then <MATH_0003> is smooth\nif the condition in Definition <REF_0001> is assumed to\nhold only for small extensions <MATH_0004>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:a7e6c10902edafaf94630bf9ebceaf2f9355a47a295ba42c79cb348b49e3b204", "unit_id": "tag:06HH:statement"}
